# Typed Expression Examples

This suite demonstrates deterministic UTC windows, numeric expressions,
generators, typed structured bodies, and invariant URL interpolation. It is
self-contained because every request uses an inline mock.

```yaml
variables:
  hour_start: ${{ hour_end - hours(1) }}
  hour_end: ${{ start_of_hour(utc_now()) }}
  read_time: ${{ hour_start + minutes(20) }}
  epoch_seconds: ${{ unix_seconds(read_time) }}
  epoch_milliseconds: ${{ epoch_seconds * 1000 }}
  initial_value: 1000.0
  next_value: ${{ initial_value + 1.25 }}
  sensor_ref: ${{ random_hex(16) }}
  reading_id: ${{ uuid() }}
```

## Typed Structured Body

```yaml
test: typed-structured-body
post: https://api.example.com/demo/telemetry
body:
  sensor:
    reference: $sensor_ref
  readingId: $reading_id
  readTime: $read_time
  epochSeconds: $epoch_seconds
  epochMilliseconds: $epoch_milliseconds
  enabled: true
  measurement:
    kilowattHours: $next_value
mock_only: true
mock:
  status: 204
expect:
  status: 204
```

## Invariant URL Interpolation

```yaml
test: invariant-date-url
get: https://api.example.com/demo/readings?start=$hour_start&end=${{ format(hour_end, 'O') }}
mock_only: true
mock:
  status: 200
  body:
    result:
      count: 1
expect:
  status: 200
  values:
    - key: $.result.count
      op: equals
      value: 1
```
